Aravis
------

The default GenICam provider links to Aravis. When a compatible system copy is
not available, the build downloads the pinned Aravis source release configured
in vixel_aravis_vendor. Aravis is distributed under the GNU Lesser General
Public License v2.1. Its source and license are available at:

https://github.com/AravisProject/aravis

LUCID Arena SDK
---------------

The optional vixel_lucid provider can link to a separately installed LUCID
Arena SDK. The SDK is not included in this repository. Users are responsible
for obtaining it from LUCID Vision Labs and complying with its license.

